# Nguon nay duoc kiem bang ma hash byte (source/ giu nguyen ban goc), nen duong dan
# xuong dong phai giong nhau tren moi may. Neu de Git tu doi CRLF khi clone tren Linux,
# phep kiem "nguon khong doi" se that bai khong vi ly do noi dung.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.obj binary
*.zip binary
*.svg text eol=lf
